          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Nighttime observation in the sky of the silent movement of a \"white bar\" passing through the constellation Ursa Major: observation of the satellite train Starlink® group 11.1 resulting from the launch carried out by SpaceX that morning from the Vandenberg base in the United States.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "5b3e1a4936f031f112985423857dbc35c4b84c2fe2d6df6c0217f7f78b487e41"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
